# --- v2.0 additions ---

# Developer scratch and verification harnesses. _build/audit.py, repair.py and
# assemble.py encode the append-fault workaround described in
# docs/HANDOFF_V2.md; keep a copy if you move them into a committed tools/ dir.
_build/
_p_*.txt
_assemble.py
_append_probe.txt

# Backups left by _build/repair.py when it collapses a duplicated file.
*.bak

# Tier 2 full-array reference. Built locally by data/build_full_reference.py
# from ClinVar, the GWAS Catalog and CPIC. Far too large for GitHub, which
# rejects files over 100 MB, and it is fully reproducible from the builder.
data/reference.db
data/reference.db-wal
data/reference.db-shm
data/*.txt.gz
data/*.tsv.gz
data/_cache/
data/_build_freq.log

# The local SNPedia cache must NEVER be committed. SNPedia is
# CC-BY-NC-SA-3.0-US, so redistributing a harvested copy would relicense this
# repository. The harvester writes to ~/.dnainsight/ deliberately, outside the
# tree, but these patterns are a second line of defence.
snpedia_cache.db
*snpedia_cache*
.dnainsight/
